{"id":146585932,"slug":"open-comment-outsiders","title":"Open Comment Outsiders","subtitle":"The Future of Digital Therapeutics, 2025.","post_date":"2024-07-13T22:13:31.998Z","audience":"everyone","type":"podcast","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/open-comment-outsiders","wordcount":183,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:52:19.753Z","body_sha256":"ab31c6dc5bdb0c3628738035fd4dcf50fcddb9436db5a772c9420164d0a4d7cc","text_words":184,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>My friend and RAMHT co-founder, Grady Hannah, had a quick and dirty conversation with two friends today about the thrilling<a href=\"https://www.cms.gov/medicare/payment/fee-schedules/physician\"> 2025 CMS Physician Fee Schedule. </a>Every year, there is an open comment period on these proposed changes, and this year has some crucial changes for physicians who’d love to be able to deploy Digital Theraputics in the context of Behavioral Health Disorders.</p><p>Thanks for listening.  More coverage of this open comment period is coming soon, but here is a quick overview of the issues at stake.   </p><p>Yes, this is how nerdy we are at baseline.  Yes, we talk like this to each other for fun.  This time, we recorded it.  Yes, I am this boring.  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljR1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3280916d-f5d4-436c-8899-e00b1a5115e3_2304x1536.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljR1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3280916d-f5d4-436c-8899-e00b1a5115e3_2304x1536.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljR1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3280916d-f5d4-436c-8899-e00b1a5115e3_2304x1536.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljR1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3280916d-f5d4-436c-8899-e00b1a5115e3_2304x1536.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljR1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3280916d-f5d4-436c-8899-e00b1a5115e3_2304x1536.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljR1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3280916d-f5d4-436c-8899-e00b1a5115e3_2304x1536.heic\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3280916d-f5d4-436c-8899-e00b1a5115e3_2304x1536.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:971,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:288814,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ljR1